# Accepted-risk list for the Trivy image scans (docker.yml). Every entry here is a
# vendor-side CVE: the fix exists upstream but is not yet in a published image for
# the pinned version. When a patched release lands, Dependabot bumps the pin in
# monitoring/docker-compose.yml and these entries fall out of the scan. Each entry
# carries an expiry (exp:) — if it passes while the finding is still present, the
# CI gate turns red on purpose and the pin gets re-reviewed.
#
# Targets: prom/prometheus:v3.14.0, grafana/grafana:13.0.7 (latest stable at pin
# time 2026-08-24).

# Prometheus v3.14.0: vendored prometheus module — fix 0.311.3 not yet released.
CVE-2026-42154 exp:2027-02-28

# Grafana 13.0.7 — Go stdlib, fixes pending a Grafana rebuild (go 1.26.4-1.26.6).
